atlas substrate
# The 14 Reality Foundry substrates. Constitutional restriction (atlas README):
# a substrate OWNS MECHANICS. It may not inherit the semantics of the
# architectures that ride it. Every entry states that as a forbidden_inference.
#
# Maturity is real, not aspirational: 13 substrates are vendored, built and
# probed under ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1, each with a recorded live-upstream
# semantic proof (state=passed, output_digest) -- consumed by
# components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate_evidence.py, never re-derived. They are
# measured. HVM4 is implemented via a real hvm reduction (substrate_hvm.py); its
# HVM2->HVM4 upgrade is the one open gap.

architecture yaff
  canonical_name YaFF
  family substrate
  domain Reality Foundry
  layer substrate
  semantic_question What is the semantic contract for a trial's artifacts, effects, and expected witnesses?
  purpose Semantic contract / IR for the trial: artifacts, effects, expected witnesses.
  maturity measured
  internal_calculus block-and-field contract representation
  internal_calculus probe: yaff-columnar-encode-decode-merkle-hash
  invariant a contract representation owns encoding, not the meaning of what it encodes
  forbidden_inference two architectures sharing YaFF -> the same semantics
  native_format yaff
  source_path architecture/atlas.py
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate_evidence.py
  source_path ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/yaff/source
  witness architecture/tests/test_atlas.py
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/yaff/semantic-proof.json
  source_lineage Reality Foundry 14-substrate

architecture hvm4
  canonical_name HVM4
  family substrate
  domain Reality Foundry
  layer substrate
  semantic_question What is the bounded reduction of this selected symbolic or computational structure?
  purpose Bounded recursive reduction of selected symbolic/computational structures.
  maturity implemented
  internal_calculus interaction-net reduction
  invariant owns reduction mechanics, not the meaning of the structure reduced
  forbidden_inference a reduction completing -> the reduced structure is correct
  native_format helix
  interacts fpq-seed
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate_hvm.py
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_substrate_hvm.py
  source_lineage Reality Foundry 14-substrate
  known_gap installed binary is HVM2 (2.0.22); HVM4 upgrade + hvm-lang front-end still pending

architecture automerge
  canonical_name Automerge
  family substrate
  domain Reality Foundry
  layer substrate
  semantic_question How do many agents and humans mutate candidate state without contaminating Actual?
  purpose Collaborative candidate state; Possible may be mutated freely without touching Actual.
  maturity measured
  internal_calculus CRDT merge mechanics
  internal_calculus probe: crdt-concurrent-conflict-convergence
  invariant owns conflict-free merge, not the meaning of any candidate it holds
  forbidden_inference a candidate merged in Possible -> a change to Actual
  source_path ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/automerge/source
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/automerge/semantic-proof.json
  source_lineage Reality Foundry 14-substrate

architecture feldera
  owns ReachableCapacity
  consumes ProofFrontier
  subscribes ProofFrontier
  publishes ReachableCapacity
  canonical_name Feldera
  family substrate
  domain Reality Foundry
  layer substrate
  semantic_question What are the incremental consequences of a change to events, tests, CMS, ledgers, or form readiness?
  purpose Incremental maintenance of consequences over GitHub events, test results, CMS changes, ledger updates, form readiness, live queries.
  maturity measured
  internal_calculus incremental view maintenance
  internal_calculus probe: dbsp-five-transaction-integral
  internal_calculus reachability view: fpq-sli-kv organism route under insert+retract
  internal_calculus ReachableCapacity relation: opportunities antijoin resolved-blocker facts
  invariant owns incremental recomputation, not the semantics of the views maintained
  invariant a retraction propagates; an independent proven fact survives a dependent one's withdrawal
  invariant an opportunity is withdrawn from reachable the instant a resolving fact retracts
  forbidden_inference a maintained view -> authority over what it summarizes
  interacts proof-frontier
  interacts unlock-graph
  command BonfyreProof
  source_path ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/feldera/source
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_reachability_incremental.rs
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_reachable_capacity.rs
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_reachable_capacity_live.rs
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_route_set_daemon.rs
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_maintained_relations.rs
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/full_retraction_cascade.sh
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/maintained_relations_witness.sh
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate_feldera.py
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/reachability_bridge.py
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/feldera/semantic-proof.json
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/feldera/reachability-proof.json
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/feldera/reachable-capacity-proof.json
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_substrate_feldera.py
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_reachability_bridge.py
  source_lineage Reality Foundry 14-substrate
  known_gap live-fabric relations now feed the DBSP engine via reachability_bridge (backfilled from real state, DBSP reproduces the Python answer exactly); remaining is a persistent long-lived circuit fed by fabric change-deltas rather than a per-tick reseed

architecture egglog
  canonical_name egglog
  family substrate
  domain Reality Foundry
  layer substrate
  semantic_question What are the equivalent alternatives to this plan, rewrite, representation, or composition?
  purpose Equivalence search over execution plans, rewrites, data representations, API compositions, patch transformations.
  maturity measured
  internal_calculus e-graph equality saturation
  internal_calculus probe: bounded-equality-saturation-and-check
  invariant owns equivalence-search machinery, not the correctness of a chosen alternative
  forbidden_inference two forms found equivalent by search -> equivalent under every architecture's algebra
  source_path ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/egglog/source
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/egglog/semantic-proof.json
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/egglog/target/release/egglog
  source_lineage Reality Foundry 14-substrate

